<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA DECLARE SECOND INNINGS AT 277-4.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA DECLARE SECOND INNINGS AT 277-4.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, ahead by 41 runs on first innings, declared at 277 for four on the final day of their four-day tour match against Guyana on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 341 and 277-4 declared (N.Sidhu 103, S.Ganguly 81), Guyana 300.</p>
</text>
